[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0721","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0721.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21262","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）存在用户界面关键信息错误表示漏洞（CWE-451），未经授权的远程攻击者可通过网络诱导用户访问特制网页，利用浏览器地址栏或安全指示器的 UI 渲染缺陷实施欺骗攻击，导致用户误判当前访问页面的真实来源。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需提前认证，但需要用户交互配合。成功利用可导致低度的机密性和完整性影响。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21262"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-24T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:55Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 升级至 132.0.2957.127 或更高版本，可通过 Edge 浏览器内置更新（设置 > 关于 Microsoft Edge > 检查更新）或从官网 https://www.microsoft.com/edge 下载最新版。该漏洞为 UI 欺骗漏洞，攻击者需诱使用户点击恶意链接，建议同时启用 Edge 的增强安全模式（设置 > 隐私、搜索和服务 > 增强你的在线安全）作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21262","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5ed23ad1e6e5869267a4c8091cffdf6711227b5/2025/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2025/CVE-2025-21262.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21262"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0721.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0401","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0612","title":"Google Chrome V8 内存越界访问漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 132.0.6834.110 之前版本中的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在越界内存访问漏洞（CWE-125）。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎在处理 JavaScript 对象时发生越界读取，导致堆内存损坏，进而造成浏览器崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需用户交互即可触发（CVSS 攻击复杂度为低），影响所有使用受影响 Chrome 版本的用户。Google 已在 132.0.6834.110 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0612"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-22T20:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 132.0.6834.110 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Opera、Brave）请同步更新至对应修复版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新 chromium 包（如 openSUSE 已发布 openSUSE-SU-2025:0034-1）。无法立即升级时，可禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施（chrome://settings/content/javascript），但会严重影响正常浏览功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_22.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/385155406","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0612.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/347fea450bbb600a02904f9eaa5ce5c35747c461/data/2025/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-0612.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/aced02b678cc4062da6e11482c0850c64f73ef89/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-06xx/CVE-2025-0612.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0399","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0611","title":"Google Chrome V8 对象内存损坏漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎 Maglev 编译器中存在对象内存损坏漏洞，由于编译器在处理寄存器状态时存在验证缺陷，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面触发堆内存损坏。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，成功利用可导致浏览器崩溃或潜在的内存数据破坏。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 132.0.6834.110 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。Google 已在 132.0.6834.110 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0611"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-22T20:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:48Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 132.0.6834.110 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查并安装更新。使用基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）的用户应同步更新至对应修复版本。Linux 发行版用户请更新 chromium 软件包，openSUSE 用户参考 openSUSE-SU-2025:0034-1 安全公告，FreeBSD 用户将 qt6-webengine 更新至 6.8.2 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_22.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/386143468","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0611.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0611.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0611.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0611","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-0611.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/62332de42038a68372e7cd3072dfdf9ce28b6878/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-83vc-v46q-mv3w/GHSA-83vc-v46q-mv3w.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-0611","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0611.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2025/FreeBSD-2025-0031.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0379","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0395","title":"GNU glibc assert 函数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU C Library（glibc）2.13 至 2.40 版本的 assert() 函数在断言失败时，未能为断言失败消息字符串及大小信息分配足够的内存空间。当消息字符串大小与页面边界对齐时，会触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞为本地攻击向量，攻击复杂度低，无需特权及用户交互即可触发，仅影响系统可用性。受影响的 Linux 发行版需升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0395"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-22T13:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 GNU C Library (glibc) 至 2.41 及以上版本（含 2.42），该版本已包含 assert() 缓冲区溢出修复提交 68ee0f704cb8。各 Linux 发行版用户应通过包管理器安装对应安全更新：Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade libc6`，RHEL/CentOS 运行 `yum update glibc`，Alpine 运行 `apk upgrade musl`（如使用 musl）。无法立即升级时，可移除或禁用存在 assert() 触发的 setuid 程序作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32582","https://sourceware.org/git/?p=glibc.git;a=blob;f=advisories/GLIBC-SA-2025-0001","https://sourceware.org/pipermail/libc-announce/2025/000044.html","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/22/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/22/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/23/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/13/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/24/7","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/04/msg00039.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250228-0006/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-398330.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-577017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0395.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0395.json","https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/5e3ec1ca9cdad76fcda8b283dd3204a60e6d2e63/Formula/g/glibc.rb","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0395","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/g/glibc/glibc.spec","https://github.com/securefederatedai/openfederatedlearning/blob/a4f8ae1e6507f617c3b90f602a20b61fa848031d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0395.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-0395.md","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/acc5fb904035c2c354774d9580ce8ef03308c548/pkgs/development/libraries/glibc/2.42-master.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0395.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0882","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0882.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21521","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server的线程池（Thread Pooling）组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络利用多种协议向目标服务器发送特制请求，触发该漏洞导致MySQL服务挂起或频繁可重复崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务（DOS）。该漏洞影响MySQL Server 8.0.39及更早版本、8.4.2及更早版本以及9.0.1及更早版本。由于攻击无需身份验证且攻击复杂度低，攻击者可在用户无感知的情况下远程利用此漏洞。CVSS 3.1基础评分为7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21521"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T21:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:40Z","remediation":"建议立即将 MySQL Server 升级到 8.0.40、8.4.3 或 9.1.0 及更高版本，或应用 Oracle 2025 年 1 月关键补丁更新（CPU）以修复线程池组件中的资源分配缺陷。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙或安全组限制对 MySQL 端口 3306 的网络访问，仅允许可信源 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250124-0010/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21521.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21521.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21521.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0882.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0881","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0881.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21490","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 的 InnoDB 存储引擎组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。受影响的版本包括 8.0.40 及更早版本、8.4.3 及更早版本、9.1.0 及更早版本。该漏洞易于利用，具有高权限且可通过多种网络协议访问 MySQL Server 的远程攻击者，可通过向服务器发送特制请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可能导致 MySQL Server 进程挂起或频繁崩溃，造成完全拒绝服务（DOS），影响数据库的正常可用性。CVSS 3.1 基础评分为 4.9（中等严重程度）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21490"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T21:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:36Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Oracle MySQL Server 到官方发布的最新安全补丁版本。对于受影响的 8.0.40、8.4.3 和 9.1.0 系列，建议升级至 8.0.41 及以上版本，或 8.4.4 及以上版本，或 9.1.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过限制高权限用户网络访问或在防火墙中封锁多个协议端口作为临时缓解措施，以降低攻击者利用此漏洞导致服务崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2025.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00000.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0004/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21490.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/20c018f1a1b9bca1242ee2249074773858b2a0ac/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21490.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21490.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/4b99b0b4e912d3267dfabab38201827bab8bf793/references/CVE-2025-21490-2025-03-01-1205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0881.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0911","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0911.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21658","title":"Linux内核 btrfs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统模块中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当使用 `rescue=all,ro` 挂载选项挂载范围树根已损坏的 btrfs 磁盘映像后，如果触发 scrub 操作，`scrub_find_fill_first_stripe()` 函数会依赖 extent root 来定位数据与元数据范围，但在范围树根无效的情况下 extent_root 为空指针，该函数却未对空指针进行校验，导致在 `find_first_extent_item` 中触发空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。攻击者需具备本地访问权限并能够挂载损坏的 btrfs 映像，通过 ioctl 触发 scrub 操作即可导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 btrfs 文件系统的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分为 5.5，危害等级为中等。内核维护者已在修复补丁中对 extent root 有效性增加额外检查，确保在范围树无效时提前返回错误而非直接解引用空指针。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21658"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:57Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：6.6.72、6.12.10 或 6.13 及以上版本。对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS，请安装 linux 6.8.0-60.63 及以后版本；对于 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS，请安装 linux-aws-6.8 6.8.0-1029.31~22.04.1 及以后版本。运行 apt update && apt install linux-image-generic 进行更新，然后重启系统。如运行 6.6 以下内核且无法立即升级，需手动回移植入 scrub_find_fill_first_stripe() 的 extent root 空指针检查补丁（commit 24b85a8b0310e0144da9ab30be42e87e6476638a）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/24b85a8b0310e0144da9ab30be42e87e6476638a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6aecd91a5c5b68939cf4169e32bc49f3cd2dd329","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aee5f69f3e6cd82bfefaca1b70b40b6cd8f3f784","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21658.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/76a9c1d3e08b5513880c6f072ae2e14cd09953e6/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21658.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21658.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21658.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21658"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0911.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0910","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0910.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21656","title":"Linux kernel hwmon drivetemp 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drivetemp 硬件监控驱动程序在处理 SCSI 命令错误时存在缺陷。scsi_execute_cmd() 函数可能同时返回负值（Linux 内核错误码）和正值（SCSI 命令结果字段）两种类型的错误码，而当前驱动程序未正确区分这两种错误码，直接将其传递给 hwmon 核心层。由于 hwmon 核心仅识别负值错误码，当发生 SCSI 错误（如磁盘驱动器被断开连接）时，正值错误码会被误判为成功，导致驱动程序向用户空间返回未初始化的垃圾数据。该漏洞影响使用 drivetemp 驱动的 Linux 内核系统，攻击条件为本地低权限用户或 SCSI 设备出现错误状态，攻击者可利用此问题获取不准确的硬件监控数据或造成信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21656"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-21T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:56Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.72、6.12.10 或更高版本（含 6.13 系列），或向内核上游合并补丁 commit 82163d63ae7a4c36142cd252388737205bb7e4b9。Ubuntu 用户可执行 apt update && apt install linux-image-generic 安装最新内核更新。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 hwmon 接口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42268d885e44af875a6474f7bba519cc6cea6a9d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/53e25b10a28edaf8c2a1d3916fd8929501a50dfc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82163d63ae7a4c36142cd252388737205bb7e4b9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21656.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21656.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21656.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21656.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21656.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21656.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2025/CVE-2025-21656.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21656.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21656.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21656"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0910.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0909","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21652","title":"Linux Kernel ipvlan 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ipvlan 子系统中存在释放后使用漏洞。由于 ipvlan 未对底层物理设备维护引用计数，当 linkwatch 工作队列处理 ipvlan 设备时，底层设备可能已被释放，导致在 ipvlan_get_iflink() 中访问已释放的 phy_dev 指针。该漏洞影响使用 ipvlan 虚拟化技术的 Linux 内核系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。具有本地低权限访问权限的攻击者可通过竞争条件触发该漏洞，在设备注销过程中触发 linkwatch 工作队列访问已释放内存，导致权限提升或系统崩溃。Linux 内核社区已在后续版本中通过为底层设备添加引用计数保护及使用 RCU 机制修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21652"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:56Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：6.6.72、6.12.10 或 6.13 及以上版本。该漏洞源于 ipvlan 模块在设备注销后仍访问已释放的底层网络设备内存，导致 use-after-free。主流发行版方面，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户应安装 linux-image-6.8.0-60 或更高版本，Ubuntu 24.10 用户应安装 6.11.0-21 或更高版本。如短期内无法完成内核升级，可通过 sysctl 禁用 ipvlan 模块加载作为临时缓解措施：执行 echo \"blacklist ipvlan\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-ipvlan.conf 并更新 initramfs，同时避免使用 ipvlan 网络接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52a24538d569f48e79d1a169a5d359d384152950","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba9f7c16ec879c83bb4f80406773a911aace8267","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb358ff94154774d031159b018adf45e17673941","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21652.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/76a9c1d3e08b5513880c6f072ae2e14cd09953e6/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21652.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21652.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21652.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21652"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0908","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21651","title":"Linux Kernel hns3 网络驱动竞争条件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"` tags.<value>Linux 内核 hns3 网络驱动程序中存在竞争条件漏洞。该漏洞源于杂项向量在请求中断时被自动启用，但服务任务尚未初始化完成，两者之间存在时间窗口。若在此窗口期内有中断被触发，系统将输出警告信息甚至导致系统不稳定。该漏洞影响搭载华为 hns3 网卡的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并具有一定操作复杂度才能触发，主要危害为系统可用性降低。Linux 内核社区已通过禁用自动启用杂项向量的方式修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21651"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:56Z","remediation":"Linux 内核 hns3 驱动存在竞争条件漏洞（CVE-2025-21651），在中断请求与杂项向量初始化之间存在时间窗口，可能导致内核警告甚至系统不稳定。建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.10 或更高版本（含 6.13+），以包含 commit 98b1e3b27734139c76295754b6c317aa4df6d32e 的修复。对于 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 等仍受影响的发行版，请执行 apt update && apt upgrade 安装最新内核补丁。如暂无法升级内核，可在 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 blacklist hns3 临时禁用该驱动模块（仅在不使用该网卡时适用），或升级至 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 获取已修复的 6.8.0-1025.29 内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/98b1e3b27734139c76295754b6c317aa4df6d32e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcf430d3bb5525fc89a92a0c451c725ba1aa4306","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21651.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21651.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21651.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21651.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21651.md","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21651.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21651.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2025/CVE-2025-21651.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21651.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2025-21651.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0907","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0907.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21650","title":"Linux kernel hns3 网络驱动 BAR 空间越界访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 hns3 网络驱动中的 hclge_fetch_pf_reg 函数存在越界读取漏洞。该函数在读取 TQP BAR 空间信息时未区分 TQP 的段地址划分，而 TQP 0-1023 与 1024-1279 位于不同的 BAR 空间地址段。当系统配置的 TQP 数量超过 1024 时，函数会错误地访问超出当前 BAR 空间范围的内存地址，导致内核出现页面错误异常。攻击者若能在拥有本地低权限访问的系统上触发网卡寄存器读取操作（如通过 ethtool -d 等命令），即可导致内核崩溃或信息泄露，影响运行 Linux 内核的华为 hns3 网卡设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21650"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:17:25Z","remediation":"建议升级至包含 hns3 驱动修复的 Linux 内核版本。对于华为网络控制器（HNS3）设备，请确保内核版本 ≥ 6.12-rc6 或更高。修复已合并在 2025-01-08 的 hclge_fetch_pf_reg 函数修正中，请更新内核到最新长期支持（LTS）分支，如 Ubuntu 24.04 的 6.11 内核版本或直接应用内核补丁。升级后重启网络服务可恢复设备功能。未能立即更新时，可通过 ethtool 禁用受影响的网卡端口以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0575baa733fc4219f230aef22d5bc35d922f1e9a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7997ddd46c54408bcba5e37fe18b4d832e45d4d4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21650.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21650.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21650.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21650.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21650.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21650.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21650.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21650.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21650.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21650.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0907.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0906","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21649","title":"Linux 内核 hns3 网络驱动空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 hns3 网络驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。HIP08 设备未注册 ptp 设备，导致 hdev->ptp 指针为 NULL，但数据发送流程仍会尝试使用 SKBTX_HW_TSTAMP 标志设置硬件时间戳信息，从而触发内核崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 hns3 驱动的华为网络设备，本地低权限攻击者可通过发送带有 1588 协议时间戳标志的特制数据包触发此漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务。CVSS v3.1 评分为 5.5，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21649"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:55Z","remediation":"升级 Linux kernel 至 6.12.10 或更高稳定版本（含 6.13.x 主线版），该漏洞修复补丁已随内核稳定版发布。受影响版本范围为 5.14 至 6.12.9 及 6.13 候选版本。Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 LTS、Debian 12 等发行版用户应安装系统提供的最新内核更新。如暂时无法升级且系统使用 HIP08 网卡，可临时通过 ethtool 或 sysfs 禁用该网卡的 PTP 硬件时间戳功能，或通过 iptables 过滤 IEEE 1588 报文（UDP 端口 319/320），以降低触发内核空指针崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9741e72b2286de8b38de9db685588ac421a95c87","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f19ab3ef96d9626e5f1bdc56d3574c355e83d623","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21649.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21649.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21649.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21649.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21649"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0905","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0905.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21645","title":"Linux 内核 AMD PMC 驱动 唤醒管理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux内核platform/x86/amd/pmc驱动存在电源管理回调处理逻辑缺陷。该驱动使用DEFINE_SIMPLE_DEV_PM_OPS()将amd_pmc_suspend_handler()注册为.suspend、.freeze和.poweroff三个电源管理回调，但i8042键盘控制器驱动仅将其suspend处理函数注册为.suspend回调。当系统从冻结或关机状态恢复时，PMC驱动会错误地禁用IRQ1唤醒源，而i8042并未实际启用该唤醒源，导致IRQ唤醒深度计数器降至零以下，触发内核\"Unbalanced IRQ 1 wake disable\"警告。该漏洞影响使用AMD x86平台并搭载i8042控制器的Linux内核系统，具有本地低权限访问权限的攻击者可在系统全新启动后直接触发休眠（S4）或冻结操作而无需先进入s2idle状态，导致内核产生不平衡IRQ警告日志，影响系统电源管理稳定性与可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21645"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:19Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.16、6.1.140、6.6.72、6.12.10 或 6.13 及更高版本。受影响版本包括 5.15.95 至 5.16、6.1.11 至 6.1.140、6.2.1 至 6.6.72 以及 6.7 至 6.12.10。可通过发行版包管理器（apt、dnf、zypper 等）更新内核，或从 kernel.org 下载编译安装对应版本，更新后重启系统以使修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5cc621085e2b7a9b1905a98f8e5a86bb4aea2016","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ab47d72b736e78d3c2370b26e0bfc46eb0918391","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b25778c87a6bce40c31e92364f08aa6240309e25","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd410d784402c5775f66faf8b624e85e41c38aaf","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00010.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21645.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21645.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21645.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21645.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21645.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21645.md","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21645.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21645-2025-11-03-1304","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21645.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2025/CVE-2025-21645.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0905.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0904","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0904.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21642","title":"Linux 内核 MPTCP sysctl 调度器空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MPTCP sysctl 调度器代码通过 current->nsproxy 访问网络命名空间结构体，存在空指针解引用漏洞。当进程退出时 current->nsproxy 已被释放，内核仍尝试读取 current->nsproxy->netns 导致崩溃。本地低权限用户可通过调用 acct(2) 等触发 proc_sys 处理路径的系统调用利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13.0-rc5 及更早版本，CVSS v3.1 评分 5.5（MEDIUM）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21642"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:54Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.13 或更高版本，其中包含 mptcp 系统调用调度程序修复；或者在内核启动时通过配置 sysctl.mptcp.sched=1 启用修复机制，避免使用已退出的任务的网络命名空间结构；如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 mptcp 功能或限制敏感系统调用的访问权限以降低影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6035702381c35a8f16757332381e58b348a9eaf9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c0e394fd6b887e84da17e38aaa6c1c104f9c86c2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d38e26e36206ae3d544d496513212ae931d1da0a","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21642.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21642.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21642.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21642.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21642.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21642.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21642.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21642.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21642.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21642.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0904.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0903","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0903.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21640","title":"Linux 内核 SCTP 子系统 cookie_hmac_alg 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核中 SCTP 协议的 sysctl 参数 `cookie_hmac_alg` 存在空指针解引用（NULL pointer dereference，CWE-476）漏洞。该参数通过 `current` 结构体间接获取 `net` 命名空间信息，但 `current->nsproxy` 在某些情况下（如当前任务正在退出）可能为 NULL，从而触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃（Oops）。攻击者可在本地获取受限权限后，通过修改相关 sysctl 设置（利用 acct(2) 等触发场景）来利用该漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响多个发行版的 Linux 内核，CVSS 3.1 评分为 7.1，危害等级高，攻击向量为本地、低复杂度，需要低权限。修复方案是通过 `container_of()` 直接从表数据中获取 `net` 结构，避免使用 `current->nsproxy`，相关补丁已合入 Linux 内核主分支，并随 SUSE、Debian、Ubuntu 等厂商安全公告（如 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1、DLA-4075-1、USN-7381-1 等）发布。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21640"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:17:03Z","remediation":"该漏洞是 Linux 内核 sctp sysctl 处理 remote_hmac_alg 时通过 current->nsproxy 获取 net 结构可能触发空指针解引用（CWE-476），导致系统崩溃（内核 oops）。建议优先升级内核到包含 commit 修复的版本，将内核更新到 6.6 系列 6.6.7x 之后、6.12 系列 6.12.x 最新稳定版，或发行版安全内核版本：Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 内核升级至 USN-7381-1 所指定版本，Debian 11 升级至 DLA-4075 对应内核（如 6.1__*），SUSE 升级至 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1 指定 kernel-default 版本。如无法立即升级，暂不可关闭 SCTP，可用 sysctl 停用不信任的协议以降低暴露面，并在更新前对系统做监控，防范本地利用导致的拒绝服务；长期应保持内核安全补丁及时更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03ca51faba2b017bf6c90e139434c4117d0afcdc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3cd0659deb9c03535fd61839e91d4d4d3e51ac71","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5599b212d2f4466e1832a94e9932684aaa364587","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86ddf8118123cb58a0fb8724cad6979c4069065b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad673e514b2793b8d5902f6ba6ab7e890dea23d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ea62dd1383913b5999f3d16ae99d411f41b528d4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f0bb3935470684306e4e04793a20ac4c4b08de0b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21640.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21640.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21640.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21640.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21640.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21640.md","https://github.com/RedHatProductSecurity/aegis-ai/blob/2e1430d90ca3b8234fa3c3fd031fd0135ed9cf5c/evals/osidb_cache/CVE-2025-21640.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21640-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21640-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21640.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0903.toml"}]